  "notes": "{言|い}い{逃|のが}れる is a compound verb with a negative connotation.\n\nVERB FORMATION:\n- {言|い}う (to say) + {逃|のが}れる (to escape)\n\nFORMS:\n- {言|い}い{逃|のが}れ (excuse, evasion)\n\nUSAGE:\n- Often implies dishonesty or avoiding rightful blame\n- Has a negative connotation\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {言|い}い{訳|わけ}をする (to make an excuse)\n- {逃|に}げ{口上|こうじょう} (excuse, pretext)\n- {弁解|べんかい}する (to justify oneself)",
